  {
   "id": "e0556",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 568,
   "y": 132,
   "width": 293.15000000000003,
   "height": 308.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1.5,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 4402964,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 58229324,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "lane = 4 (m mod 8) + floor((n mod 8) / 2)\n\nThread t, value (v0, v1, v2):\nm = floor((t mod 32) / 4) + 8 v1 + 16 w\nn = 2 (t mod 4) + v0 + 8 v2\nw = floor(t / 32) is the warp.\n\nWarp w owns rows 16w .. 16w + 15.\nColumns 16..63 repeat the pattern:\nv2 runs 0..7, one 8-column group each.\n\nLane 0 (highlighted): rows 0 and 8,\ncolumns 0, 1, 8, 9, ..., 56, 57:\n2 rows x 16 columns = 32 values,\nthe N/2 = 32 f32 registers of PTX.\n\nA row is shared by 4 consecutive lanes\n(t mod 4 picks the column pair), which\nis the threads_in_group=4 reduction.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "lane = 4 (m mod 8) + floor((n mod 8) / 2)\n\nThread t, value (v0, v1, v2):\nm = floor((t mod 32) / 4) + 8 v1 + 16 w\nn = 2 (t mod 4) + v0 + 8 v2\nw = floor(t / 32) is the warp.\n\nWarp w owns rows 16w .. 16w + 15.\nColumns 16..63 repeat the pattern:\nv2 runs 0..7, one 8-column group each.\n\nLane 0 (highlighted): rows 0 and 8,\ncolumns 0, 1, 8, 9, ..., 56, 57:\n2 rows x 16 columns = 32 values,\nthe N/2 = 32 f32 registers of PTX.\n\nA row is shared by 4 consecutive lanes\n(t mod 4 picks the column pair), which\nis the threads_in_group=4 reduction.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseline": 13
  }
 ],
